# npm pack extraction residue (npm pack + tar -x leaves a package/ dir behind)
/packages/cli/package/

# Packaged VS Code extension. A release artifact, not source: it belongs on the
# Marketplace or a GitHub Release. A .vsix is a zip carrying mtimes, so
# `npm run package:vscode` rewrites it with identical contents but different bytes --
# tracking it dirtied the tree on every build and cost every clone 752 KB. Build it with
# `npm run package:vscode`; docs/installation.md walks through installing the result.
/packages/vscode/*.vsix

